OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's 'unimaginable' loss after
OL,4,Avan driver killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a van driver killed in a
OL,7,Fcrash with a lorry in Aberdeenshire
OL,8,Fhave said his loss has left an
OL,9,F"unimaginable emptiness" in their
OL,10,Flives.
OL,12,FMarc McGregor, 36, died at the scene
OL,13,Fafter his Vauxhall Combo van and a
OL,14,FVolvo skip loader lorry collided on the
OL,15,FA947 near Fyvie on 10 September.
OL,17,FThe 33-year-old driver of the Volvo
OL,18,Florry was taken to hospital for
OL,19,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
