OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's 'unimaginable' loss after
OL,4,Avan driver killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, McGregor's family paid
OL,7,Ftribute to him as a "loving partner,
OL,8,Fcherished son and devoted dad and
OL,9,Fstep-dad".
